{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/15/itm_afcb311863187516/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20245","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-10-15T02:50:00Z","content_hash":"32f3f6c499c9b0e5ef754d6802b8b83a0d93653c24ad444b1bf519166c1e150a","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and submission metadata","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20245"},{"label":"arXiv HTML full text","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2610.20245v1"},{"label":"Official P2Patch code repository","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/P2Patch/P2patch"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2610.20245v1","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T02:50:00Z","fingerprint":"32f3f6c499c9b0e5ef754d6802b8b83a0d93653c24ad444b1bf519166c1e150a","id":"itm_afcb311863187516","item_id":"itm_afcb311863187516","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-14T14:19:21Z","sort_at":"2026-10-14T14:19:21Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"P2Patch 是 2026-10-14 发布的 AI for Security 论文，研究自动漏洞修复不能只用构造补丁时见过的 PoV 自证正确这一 oracle-reuse 问题。它让 exploiter 先构造并执行 bootstrap PoV、patcher 修复代码，再由 exploiter 对已接受补丁搜索同漏洞的 distinct bypass；每个执行确认的绕过被累积为永久修复约束，最终用与构造阶段隔离的 fix-closed 和 residual oracle 评分。VulnRepairBench 覆盖 101 个 C/C++ 与 Java CVE、61 个仓库和 20 类 weakness；41% 的运行在原 PoV 已被阻断后仍找到新的确认绕过。相对同 finding 的单次 Claude Code 修复，held-out fix-closed coverage 从 78.1% 升至 84.7%，beyond-upstream residual coverage 从 42.1% 升至 62.5%。局限是 oracle 只覆盖已认证路径、收益受模型与预算影响、公共 CVE 可能存在预训练记忆，且评测容器不构成对恶意仓库的完整隔离。","tags":["ai-safety","ai-for-security","vulnerability-repair","agentic-repair","counterexample-guided-synthesis","security-oracle","CVE"],"title":"P2Patch: Exploit-Guided Vulnerability Repair","title_hash":"1dcc0b3e20b34b930a5cdd5177026ad145fc0c36ed55c50c2a8e54cbc2bb457d","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20245"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/12/itm_9b99dac7607853de/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.16152","category_id":"llm-post-training","collected_at":"2026-10-15T02:45:01Z","content_hash":"320fe522b7ef47d8e0ec354642920d44e1530f4ced06929f673dbfb1c0f1a59a","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and submission history","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.16152"},{"label":"arXiv HTML full text","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2610.16152"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2610.16152","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T02:45:01Z","fingerprint":"320fe522b7ef47d8e0ec354642920d44e1530f4ced06929f673dbfb1c0f1a59a","id":"itm_9b99dac7607853de","item_id":"itm_9b99dac7607853de","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-12T04:21:53Z","sort_at":"2026-10-12T04:21:53Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"WildTrace 在开放 Olmo-3-7B 上复现 SFT、DPO、GRPO 三阶段后训练，以同分布、可验证成员标签的数学/代码/指令/问答评测集检验训练数据检测。训练总量超250万样本，比较多类输入和输出检测器；最优 Min-K%++ 平均 AUC 仅0.529，10万样本时 TPR@5%FPR 低于0.1。域漂移可将结果虚高最多21.2%，甚至两个非成员集合间 AUC 达0.908；局限是仅覆盖开放7B模型与受控数据谱系，且实际部署常缺少同分布阈值校准集。","tags":["post-training","membership-inference","data-provenance","ai-safety","benchmark"],"title":"WildTrace: Evaluating Training Data Detection in Realistic Large-Scale LLM Post-Training","title_hash":"8d82a9e2495c184df3e0fc468f466c43a493258d0927ee5decd6e44305ecd8aa","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.16152"}
